{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25860","headline":"宿扬州水馆 · 李绅","name":"宿扬州水馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舟依浅岸参差合，桥映晴虹上下连。\n轻檝过时摇水月，远灯繁处隔秋烟。\n却思海峤还凄叹，近涉江涛更凛然。\n闲凭栏干指星汉，尚疑轩盖在楼船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}